Tasmota
https://github.com/arendst/Tasmota
Pinned source: v15.6.0, commit db3ae7e0276fdc38b7aeb241a2a8e33d8ffd6892.
The focused upstream patch retains the copyright and GPL notices of Theo Arends
and the Tasmota contributors. Tasmota and its modified source are GPL-3.0-or-later.
Its bundled libraries retain their individual licenses and copyright notices in
the integrity-checked upstream source archive; this repository does not replace
those notices or claim ownership of those libraries.

Modified by this project on 2026-10-15:
- lib/default/TasmotaPubSub/src/PubSubClient.cpp and PubSubClient.h:
  expose retained-delivery metadata only during an inbound callback.
- tasmota/include/tasmota_configurations.h: disable discovery and alternate serial
  provisioning in the fixed profile.
- tasmota/tasmota.ino: initialize inactive pins and the fixed board before GPIO
  setup; include the lease gate.
- tasmota/tasmota_support/support_command.ino: make native commands maintenance
  OFF and reject competing configuration/activation paths.
- tasmota/tasmota_support/support_tasmota.ino: route native power through the gate,
  preserve emergency OFF and stop leases before OTA.
- tasmota/tasmota_support/support_wifi.ino: stop leases before restart.
- tasmota/tasmota_xdrv_driver/xdrv_01_9_webserver.ino: stop leases before uploads.
- tasmota/tasmota_xdrv_driver/xdrv_02_9_mqtt.ino: consume the dedicated protocol
  before native logging/dispatch and reconcile MQTT lifecycle transitions.
The focused patch and original upstream copyright/license notices are preserved.

